        "body": "__**Class**__\n⚔️ **Warrior**\n> 💪+3 🧠-1\nBlade and shield. Front line. The first in and the last out.\n\n🏹 **Ranger**\n> 💪+1 🧠+2 💬-1\nBow and beast. The wilds are home. You read tracks like others read letters.\n\n🔮 **Wizard**\n> 💪-2 📖+3\nArcane and ancient. The old words still work — if you dare speak them.\n\n🎵 **Bard**\n> 💪-1 📖+1 💬+2\nSong and story. A well-told tale opens more doors than any key.\n\n✝️ **Priest**\n> 🧠+2 💬+1\nFaith and flame. The old gods are quiet — but not gone.",
