        "ledger": "📝 ~~Name~~ → **Bram**\n🛡️ ~~Class~~ → ⚔️ **Warrior**\n🌱 **Upbringing** ◀\n🧬 Race\n⚖️ Alignment\n🔧 Day Job\n🎒 Starting Kit",
        "body": "__**Upbringing**__\n🎖️ **Soldier**\n> 💪+1 📖-1\nRaised in a military family. Discipline was your first language. The scars are your father's.\n\n⚖️ **Merchant**\n> 💪-1 📖+1 💬+1\nGrew up behind a counter. You could read a ledger before you could read a story.\n\n📚 **Scholar**\n> 💪-1 📖+2 💬-1\nBooks over breakfast. Your parents taught you the old tongues — some of them true.\n\n🌟 **Folk Hero**\n> 💬+1\nCommon blood, uncommon courage. Your village still tells stories about the fire you pulled them from.\n\n🏚️ **Outcast**\n> 🧠+1 💬-1\nYou grew up on the edge of things. The forest taught you what people wouldn't.\n\n👑 **Noble**\n> 💪-1 🧠-1 📖+1 💬+2\nManor-born. You learned poise, politics, and how to make a room listen.\n\n🪚 **Artisan**\n> 💪+1 🧠+1 📖-1 💬-1\nYour hands know wood, stone, or metal before your mind knows letters.\n\n🌾 **Farmstead**\n> 💪+1 🧠+1 💬-1\nYou read weather, soil, and seasons like others read books.\n\n⛪ **Temple-Raised**\n> 🧠+2 📖-1 💬-1\nGiven to the old faith as a child. The hymns are still in your bones.\n\n🗝️ **Urchin**\n> 💪+1 🧠+1 💬-2\nThe gutter taught you everything. Pockets, roofs, escape routes.\n\n🎭 **Entertainer**\n> 💪-1 📖-1 💬+2\nYou travelled with a troupe. You learned to read a room before you learned to read a page.\n\n🧭 **Scout**\n> 💪+1 🧠+2 💬-2\nRange-born. Your family kept the borders, watched the roads, knew when something changed.",
