        "body": "__**Race**__\n🧑 **Human**\n> 💬+1\nThe most common folk. Adaptable, ambitious, everywhere.\n\n🪓 **Dwarf**\n> 💪+1 🧠+1 💬-2\nStone and steel. Stocky, stubborn, unshakeable.\n\n🧝 **Elf**\n> 💪-1 🧠+1 📖+1\nGrace and age. You've seen centuries. The Oak was a sapling when you were young.\n\n🍀 **Halfling**\n> 💪-2 💬+2\nSmall and lucky. The world is big — you've learned to slip through the cracks.\n\n🌗 **Half-Elf**\n> 💪-1 🧠+1 📖+1\nTwo bloodlines, one heart. You walk between worlds — welcome in neither, at home in both.\n\n💪 **Half-Orc**\n> 💪+2 🧠-1 💬-1\nTwo bloods, one fist. You carry the strength of one world and the rejection of both.\n\n🏔️ **Dúnedain**\n> 💪+1 🧠+1 💬-1\nBlood of the West. Your people have guarded the borders for so long the villages forgot you exist.",
