        "body": "__**Alignment**__\n😇 **Lawful Good**\nOrder and compassion. The code is the shield.\n\n🕊️ **Neutral Good**\nKindness above all. Rules are tools, not masters.\n\n🔥 **Chaotic Good**\nFreedom and mercy. Break the law to save the innocent.\n\n📏 **Lawful Neutral**\nOrder is its own virtue. The code, always.\n\n⚖️ **True Neutral**\nBalance. You walk the middle road.\n\n🎲 **Chaotic Neutral**\nImpulse and instinct. No master, no chain.\n\n🗡️ **Lawful Evil**\nCruelty within the rules. The system serves you.\n\n🐍 **Neutral Evil**\nSelfishness without restraint. You take what you want.\n\n💀 **Chaotic Evil**\nDestruction for its own sake. The world burns.",
